#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Dirichlet Product Species]

Given #local("00DT")[species] $F,G$ define the dirichlet product by
$
  (F *_D G) (S) :-= sum_((T,U,e,!) : "surj-cart-dec"(S)) F(T) xx G(U),
$

where $"surj-cart-dec"(S)$ is the #local("00DQ")[type of surjective cartesian decompositions] of $S$.
